{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"さいたまダービー(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大宮アルディージャvs浦和レッズ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"精一杯応援してきました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてましての方からも声援をいただき、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂ふぁみりーのみなさんからも応援していただき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無事にライブすることができました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう、すごかった(*^^*)!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さすがさいたまダービー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜の野外も気もちーいねっ＼(^O^)／☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっそれから!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"るんるん(斎藤ちはるchan)のぱぱさん ままさん 妹さんともご挨拶しました(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妹さん可愛らしかった!ままさん似なんだそうだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぱぱさんもイケメンさんだったよ//"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/22/2557849/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ?全体に対する腕の比率がやばいおかしい('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/22/2557849/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度はさいたまスタジアムの浦和レッズのホームゲームにも来てね(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/22/2557849/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浦和レッズ好きなんでひめたんにもレッズを応援してほしいっす!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大宮も浦和もどっちもおんなじくらい応援しましたよ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんも浦和さんのホームお邪魔したい(^ω^)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"機会があったらよろしくお願いします♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/22/2557849/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リーゼントの男子は好き?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似合ってればなんでも(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結局、自分に似合う髪型をわかってる人はみんな素敵ですよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とかゆーて、自分なにが似合うんだろう。中元さーん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/22/2557849/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリキュア好き?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初代のなぎさちゃんとほのかちゃんは見てたよ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２人は好きだったなー//"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は全然見てないや(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/22/2557849/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通のカルビと炙りカルビならどっちが好きですか?ww"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのう。ひとつ聞いてもいいですかね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通のカルビと炙りカルビってそもそも何が違うのー?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何もしてないか炙ったかの違いってことー??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/22/2557849/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鬼のような仕事量こなさなきゃいけない俺に何か一言お願いします!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鬼!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鬼に負けるなー!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"辛くなったらひめたんがついてますぞ(`・ω・')"},{"type":"brea